  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop baby cos lettuce.\n• Cut tomato into thin wedges.\n• Slice avocado in half, scoop out flesh and thinly slice.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68083be8e83603ed23410fe2/step-00a7e200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook plant-based mince and sliced onion, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add Tex-Mex spice blend and cook, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Remove from heat, then stir in BBQ sauce and a splash of water, until coated. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68083be8e83603ed23410fe2/step-202f6b10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.\n• In a large bowl, combine cos lettuce, tomato, avocado and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68083be8e83603ed23410fe2/step-5369bf20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Top each tortilla with some cos salad and BBQ Tex-Mex plant-based mince.\n• Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese. Drizzle over light sour cream. Serve with remaining salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68083be8e83603ed23410fe2/step-e3875930.jpg"
    }
  ]
